Package: BayesianMGMFRM
Type: Package
Title: Fit Many-Facet and Multidimensional Generalized Rasch Models with Julia
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Ryuya", "Komuro", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "komuro.4121@gmail.com")
Description: Fit Bayesian and frequentist many-facet Rasch, generalized
    many-facet Rasch, and scale-identified multidimensional generalized
    many-facet Rasch models with 'BayesianMGMFRM.jl' from R, retaining facet
    labels, parameter covariances, Bayesian fit diagnostics, contrasts, and
    portable handoff records.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: JuliaConnectoR, jsonlite, posterior, stats, tools, graphics, utils
Suggests: digest
SystemRequirements: Julia (>= 1.10.8)
